{"Title":"An Act relative to snow hauling and removal","BillNumber":"H3039","DocketNumber":"HD2374","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DCG1","Name":"Denise C. Garlick","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DCG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T10:36:38.11"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DCG1","Name":"Denise C. Garlick","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DCG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T10:36:38.11"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3039/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garlick of Needham, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3039) of Denise C. Garlick relative to snow hauling and removal contracts and Chapter 30B, the Uniform Procurement Act.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1 of chapter 30B of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after the word “plowing” the following words:- “, snow removal, and snow hauling”. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}